1 OCCU Comte d'Artois puis Roi de France (1824-1830), King of France 1824-1830, Kung i Frankrike 1824-30, abdikerade 1830, Count of Artois, King of France & Navarre, King of France (1824-30), abdicated 2.8.1830, King of France 1824-1836
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''CHARLES X d'BOURBON KING OF FRANCE & CO-PRINCE OF ANDORRA & COUNT of ARTOIS''' [Charles, like all rulers of Foix and France since 1278 to the present, was joint ruler of the mountain nation of Andorra as Co-Prin
2 CONC ce with the Bishop of Urgell: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_co-princes_of_Andorra]
2 CONT
2 CONT Charles de Bourbon Member of the House of Bourbon.  Comte d'Artois on 9 October 1757. In July 1789 he left France. Lieutenant-General of the Kingdom on 28 January 1793. 12 April 1814 he re-entered Paris. Roi Charles X de France in
2 CONC  1824. Crowned King of France on 29 May 1825 at Rheims, Champagne, France. Comte d'Artois on 2 August 1830.  Abdicated as King of France on 2 August 1830.
2 CONT
