2 CONT      Maria Theresa, Archduchess of Austria, was born on March 20, 1762 at Vienna, Austria. (1) She was the daughter of Joseph II vor Austria, Holy Roman Emperor, and Maria Isabella di Borbone, Infanta de España. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on January 23, 1770 at age 7 in Vienna, Austria. (1) She was buried at Capuchin Church, Vienna, Austria.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Maria Theresa, Archduchess of Austria, was a member of the House of Habsburg-Lorraine. (1) She was baptised with the name of Maria Theresa Elisabeth Philippine Louise Josephe Johanna. (1) She gained the title of Erzherzogin v
2 CONC on Österreich (styled as HI&RH Archduchess of Austria). (1)
2 CONT
