2 CONT Children of  Amedeo Ferdinando Maria di Savoia and Maria Vittoria dal Pozzo:
2 CONT # Prince Emanuele Filiberto of Savoy-Aosta, Duke of Aosta (13 January 1869 – 4 July 1931), Marshal of Italy, married to Princess Hélène of Orléans and had issue.
