2 CONT # Prince Luigi Amedeo of Savoy-Aosta, Duke of the Abruzzi (29 January 1873 – 18 March 1933), Vice Admiral in the Italian Royal Navy, died unmarried.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of  Amedeo Ferdinando Maria di Savoia and Maria Letizia Bonaparte:
2 CONT # Prince Umberto of Savoy (22 June 1889 – 19 October 1918), died unmarried.
