2 CONT Spoken style	Your Royal Highness
2 CONT Alternative style	Doña
2 CONT Restoration (Spain) Spanish Royal Family: Knight Grand Cross of the Order of Charles III[15]
2 CONT Restoration (Spain) Spanish Royal Family: 620th Dame Grand Cross of the Order of Queen Maria Luisa[16]
2 CONT
