2 CONT      Karl Salvator Erzherzog von Österreich was born on 30 April 1839 at Florence, Italy. ▼3 He was the son of Leopoldo II Erzherzog von Österreich Granduca di Toscana and Maria Antoina di Borbone, Principessa di Borbone delle Due
2 CONC  Sicilie. ▼2 He married Marie Immaculee di Borbone, Principessa di Borbone delle Due Sicilie, daughter of Ferdinando II di Borbone, Re delle Due Sicilie and Maria Theresia Isabella Erzherzogin von Österreich, on 19 September 1861 
2 CONC at Rome, Italy. ▼4 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 18 January 1912 at age 72 at Vienna, Austria. ▼4 He was also reported to have died on 18 January 1892 at Vienna, Austria.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Karl Salvator Erzherzog von Österreich was a member of the House of Habsburg-Lorraine. He gained the title of Principe Karl Salvator di Toscana. He gained the title of Erzherzog von Österreich. ▼1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Karl Salvator Erzherzog von Österreich and Marie Immaculee di Borbone, Principessa di Borbone delle Due Sicilie
