1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://www.thepeerage.com/p3957.htm#i39564 #i39564 the peerage...] ; 
2 CONT * '''Heinrich Ferdinand Erzherzog von Österreich''', b. 17 August 1878, d. 21 May 1969
2 CONT * Heinrich Ferdinand Erzherzog von Österreich was born on 17 August 1878 at Salzburg, Austria. He was the son of Ferdinand IV von Österreich, Granduca di Toscana and Alix di Borbone, Principessa di Parma. He married Maria Karolina
2 CONC  Ludescher, daughter of Johann-Georg Ludescher and Barbara Prantl, on 29 November 1919. He died on 21 May 1969 at age 90 at Salzburg, Austria.
2 CONT * He was given the name of Heinrich Ferdinand Salvator Maria Joseph Leopold Karl Ludwig Pius Albert Rupert Katharina von Habsburg-Lothringen at birth. '''Children''' of Heinrich Ferdinand Erzherzog von Österreich and Maria Karolin
2 CONC a Ludescher
2 CONT
2 CONT >#    Heinrich Graf von Habsburg-Lothringen+ b. 17 Aug 1908, d. 13 Jun 1968
2 CONT >#    Othmar Graf von Habsburg-Lothringen+ b. 7 Aug 1910, d. 5 Feb 1988
2 CONT >#    Veronika Gräfin von Habsburg-Lothringen b. 15 Mar 1912
