1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_Gabriel_of_Bourbon-Two_Sicilies '''en.wikipedia.org....'''] ; 
2 CONT * Prince Gabriele Maria Giuseppe Carlo Ignazio Antonio Alfonso Pietro Giovanni Gerardo di Majella et Omni Sancti of Bourbon-Two Sicilies[1][2] (11 January 1897, Cannes, France[1][2] – 22 October 1975, Itu, Brazil[1][2]) was a memb
2 CONC er of the House of Bourbon-Two Sicilies and a Prince of Bourbon-Two Sicilies.
2 CONT ===Family===
2 CONT * Gabriel was the twelfth child and youngest son of Prince Alfonso of Bourbon-Two Sicilies, Count of Caserta and his wife Princess Maria Antonietta of Bourbon-Two Sicilies.[1][2] He was a younger brother of Prince Ferdinand Pius, 
2 CONC Duke of Calabria, Prince Carlos of Bourbon-Two Sicilies, Maria Immaculata, Princess Johann Georg of Saxony, Maria Cristina, Archduchess Peter Ferdinand of Austria, Maria di Grazia, Princess Imperial of Brazil, Prince Ranieri, Duke
2 CONC  of Castro, and Prince Philip of Bourbon-Two Sicilies.[1][2]
2 CONT ===Marriage and issue===
2 CONT * [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_Gabriel_of_Bourbon-Two_Sicilies '''read more....''']
