1 NOTE (German Franz Ferdinand)  In 1875 he inherited the title archduke of 
2 CONT Austria-Este. After the deaths of his cousin, Crown Prince Rudolf, in 
2 CONT 1889, and of his father, in 1896, Francis became heir to the 
2 CONT Austro-Hungarian crown. Because of his morganatic marriage Francis 
2 CONT relinquished all claim to the throne for his children. Although he was 
2 CONT favorably inclined toward the aspirations of the Slavs, he and his wife 
2 CONT were assassinated by Serbian nationalists. The incident precipitated World 
2 CONT War I.
1 NOTE ARCHDUKE OF AUSTRIA; HIS ASSASSINATION LED TO THE OUTBREAK OF WORLD WAR I
