2 CONT * Rainier Erzherzog von Österreich
2 CONT * M, #111764, b. 21 November 1895, d. 25 May 1930
2 CONT * Rainier Erzherzog von Österreich was born on 21 November 1895 at Zagreb, Croatia. He was the son of Leopold Salvator Erzherzog von Österreich and Blanca de Castilla de Borbón, Infanta d'España. He died on 25 May 1930 at age 34 a
2 CONC t Vienna, Austria.
2 CONT * He gained the title of Erzherzog von Österreich.  He was given the name of Rainier von Habsburg-Lothringen at birth.His name was legally changed to Rainier Habsburg-Lorraine.
2 CONT ===Citations===
2 CONT * [S12] C. Arnold McNaughton, The Book of Kings: A Royal Genealogy, in 3 volumes (London, U.K.: Garnstone Press, 1973), volume 1, page 370. Hereinafter cited as The Book of Kings.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Knight of the Order of the Golden Fleece  : Austrian Branch
