1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00010695&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT Gabriella Gräfin Apponyi de Nagy-Appony (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #335918, b. 24 April 1910, d. 16 February 1986
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=23 Feb 2009
2 CONT
2 CONT      Gabriella Gräfin Apponyi de Nagy-Appony was born on 24 April 1910 at Lieszkó. (1) She was the daughter of Karl Graf Apponyi de Nagy-Appony and Maria-Aglaë Prinzessin zu Windisch-Grätz. (1) She married, firstly, Antal Maria Pá
2 CONC l Miklós Prinz Esterházy von Galántha, son of Miklós Pál Prinz Esterházy von Galántha and Margit Gräfin Cziráky de Czirák und Dénesfalva, on 22 October 1935 at Budapest, Hungary. (1) She married, secondly, Ivan Peter Heinrich Graf
2 CONC  Draskovich von Trakostjan on 8 January 1948 at Budapest, Hungary. (1) She and Ivan Peter Heinrich Graf Draskovich von Trakostjan were divorced in 1948. (1) She married, thirdly, Wladimir Anton Graf Mittrowsky von Mittrowitz on 15
2 CONC  February 1948 at Vienna, Austria. (1) She and Wladimir Anton Graf Mittrowsky von Mittrowitz were divorced in 1950. (1) 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 16 February 1986 at age 75 at Munich, Bavaria, Germany. (1)
2 CONT
2 CONT      From 22 October 1935, her married name became Esterházy von Galántha.1 From 8 January 1948, her married name became Draskovich von Trakostjan.1 From 15 February 1948, her married name became Mittrowsky von Mittrowitz.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Gabriella Gräfin Apponyi de Nagy-Appony and Antal Maria Pál Miklós Prinz Esterházy von Galántha
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Anton Rudolf Prinz Esterházy von Galántha+ (1) b. 27 Dec 1936
2 CONT
