1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * [http://www.thepeerage.com/p11251.htm '''www.thepeerage.com.....'''] ; 
2 CONT * Don Luis Alfonso de Baviera y de Borbon, Infante of Spain1 M,''' #112503''', b. 6 December 1906, d. 14 May 1983
2 CONT * Don Luis Alfonso de Baviera y de Borbon, Infante of Spain was born on 6 December 1906 at Madrid, Spain.1 He was the son of Ferdinand Maria Ludwig Franz Prinz von Bayern and Maria Theresia de Borbón y Habsburgo, Infanta de España
2 CONC .1 He died on 14 May 1983 at age 76 at Madrid, Spain.
2 CONT * He gained the title of Infante of Spain.1 He was given the name of Luis Alfonso Fernando Cristino Adalberta Teresa Maria de Guadalupe Santiago Isidro Ramon Jose Antonio Maria de Baviera y de Borbon at birth.
