1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Golden Fleece - Knights: Austrian Branch ===
2 CONT * [http://webcache.googleusercontent.com/search?q=cache:tHmY9aaaWWoJ:en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Archduke_Hubert_Salvator_of_Austria+&cd=1&hl=en&ct=clnk&lr= '''Hubert Salvator of Austria''']
2 CONT * Archduke Hubert Salvator of Austria (German: Hubert Salvator Rainer Maria Joseph Ignatius, Erzherzog von Österreich, Prinz von Toskana (30 April 1894, Schloss Lichtenegg, Lichtenegg, Lower Austria, Austria–Hungary – 24 March 197
2 CONC 1, Schloss Persenbeug, Persenbeug-Gottsdorf, Lower Austria, Austria was a member of the Tuscan line of the House of Habsburg-Lorraine and Archduke and Prince of Austria, Prince of Hungary, Bohemia, and Tuscany by birth.
2 CONT ===Family===
2 CONT Hubert Salvator was the third child and second-eldest son of Archduke Franz Salvator of Austria and his wife Archduchess Marie Valerie of Austria. Through his mother, Hubert Salvator was a grandson of Franz Joseph I of Austria and
2 CONC  his wife Elisabeth of Bavaria.
2 CONT ===Marriage and issue===
2 CONT
2 CONT Hubert Salvator married Princess Rosemary of Salm-Salm, second eldest child and daughter of Emanuel Alfred, Hereditary Prince of Salm-Salm and his wife Archduchess Maria Christina of Austria, on 25 November 1926 civilly in Anholt 
2 CONC and religiously on 26 November 1926.[1][2] Hubert Salvator and Rosemary had thirteen children together:[1][2]
2 CONT * HI&RH Archduke Friedrich Salvator of Austria (27 November 1927 - 26 March 1999).
2 CONT * HI&RH Archduchess Agnes Christina of Austria (14 December 1928 – 31 August 2007).
2 CONT *  HI&RH Archduchess Maria Margaretha of Austria (born 29 January 1930).* 
2 CONT * HI&RH Archduchess Maria Ludovica of Austria (31 January 1931 - 17 April 1999).
2 CONT * HI&RH Archduchess Maria Adelheid of Austria (born 28 July 1933).
2 CONT * HI&RH Archduchess Elisabeth Mathilde of Austria (18 March 1935 - 9 October 1998).
2 CONT * HI&RH Archduke Andreas Salvator of Austria (born 28 April 1936) - '''Golden Fleece - Knights Austrian Branch'''
2 CONT * HI&RH Archduchess Josepha Hedwig of Austria (born 2 Sep 1937).
2 CONT * HI&RH Archduchess Valerie Isabella of Austria (born 23 May 1941).
2 CONT * HI&RH Archduchess Maria Alberta of Austria (born 1 June 1944).
2 CONT * HI&RH Archduke Markus Emanuel Salvator of Austria (born 2 April 1946).
2 CONT * HI&RH Archduke Johann Maximilian of Austria (born 18 September 1947).
2 CONT * HI&RH Archduke Michael Salvator of Austria (born 2 May 1949).
2 CONT ===Titles, styles, honours and arms===
2 CONT 30 April 1894 – 24 March 1971: His Imperial and Royal Highness Archduke and Prince Hubert Salvator of Austria; Prince Hubert Salvator of Hungary, Bohemia, and Tuscany
2 CONT ===Honours===
2 CONT * '''Knight of the Austrian Order of the Golden Fleece''
2 CONT
