2 CONT Clemens Salvator Graf von Altenburg ▼1
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #111802, b. 6 October 1904, d. 20 August 1974
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT Consanguinity Index=4.53%
2 CONT
2 CONT      Clemens Salvator Graf von Altenburg was born on 6 October 1904 at Waldsee Castle. ▼2 He was the son of Franz Salvator Erzherzog von Österreich and Marie Valerie Erzherzogin von Österreich. ▼1 He married Elisabeth Resseguier d
2 CONC e Miremont, Countess Resseguier de Miremont, daughter of Friedrich Resseguier de Miremont, Count Resseguier de Miremont and Christiane von Wolkenstein, Countess von Wolkenstein, on 20 February 1930 at Vienna, Austria. ▼2 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 20 August 1974 at age 69 at Salzburg, Austria.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Clemens Salvator Graf von Altenburg gained the title of Erzherzog von Österreich. ▼1 He was baptised with the name of Clemens Salvator Leopold Benedikt Antonius Maria Joseph Ignatius von Habsburg-Lothringen. He was created Gr
2 CONC af von Altenburg on 2 April 1930. ▼2 On 2 April 1930 his name was legally changed to Clemens von Altenburg. ▼2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Clemens Salvator Graf von Altenburg and Elisabeth Resseguier de Miremont, Countess Resseguier de Miremont
2 CONT
