1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Links:==
2 CONT *[http://thepeerage.com/p11248.htm#i112472 The Peerage]
2 CONT *[https://geneall.net/de/name/18898/max-manuel-prinz-von-bayern/ Geneall]
2 CONT *[http://www.hansdenyngre.dk/hans_uk/wizg95.htm#3267 Johann The Younger # 3123]
2 CONT *[http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prince_Max,_Duke_in_Bavaria Wikipedia]
2 CONT
2 CONT Max-Emanuel Ludwig Maria Herzog in Bayern, sometimes styled Prince Max of Bavaria, Duke in Bavaria, born 21 January 1937 as son of Albrecht, Duke of Bavaria, is the heir presumptive to both the headship of the former Bavarian Roya
2 CONC l House and the Jacobite Succession. He was born a Prince of Bavaria, as a member of the royal line of the House of Wittelsbach, but has been using the title "Herzog in Bayern" or Duke in Bavaria, since he was adopted as an adult 
2 CONC by his great-uncle, Duke Ludwig Wilhelm in Bavaria, the last bearer of that title of a junior branch of the House of Wittelsbach, from whom he inherited considerable estates at Tegernsee Abbey (including a brewery), Banz Abbey and
2 CONC  Kreuth.
