0 @N6000000002322348435@ NOTE Taken to France by his mother when she was deposed, he wouldn't return to
1 CONT Spain as king until 1875, mother having abdicated in his favor in 1870. After
1 CONT suppressing the last of the Carlist supporters, he ordered a new constitution
1 CONT which introduced a 2-party English model system into Spanish politics in
1 CONT 1876. His untimely early death was followed by the long, troubled regency for
1 CONT his wife, Maria Christina of Austria (1858-1929). His son Alfonso XIII would
1 CONT be born Postumously and Maria would take regency control of governing.
