0 @N6000000002322303648@ NOTE King of a troubled Portugal that was beset by colonial disputes, grave
1 CONT difficulties, and political unrest due to mistakes made before his time that
1 CONT proved to be the undoing of this talented nd intelligent man. In order to
1 CONT take control of his country riddled by strikes and revolts, Charles appointed
1 CONT Joao Franco as prime minister in May 1906 and allowed him dictatorial powers
1 CONT afterwards. Government coercion and controversies over extravagances of the
1 CONT private life of Charles led to his assassination on the streets of Lisbon.
