0 @N6000000002322348459@ NOTE After being under regency of his mother from 1886-1902, his reign was marked
1 CONT by continued interference in the parliamentary system and his increasing
1 CONT autocratic tendencies, Spain's neutrality in WW I, and the defeat of the
1 CONT Spanish by the Moors in Morocco in 1921. He associated himself with the
1 CONT dictatorship of Primo de Rivera in 1923-1930. Losing support of his army , he
1 CONT refused to abdicate, but left Spain in 1931 to live in exile. Hence, a 2nd
1 CONT Republic from 1931-1939 led to dictatorship under Franco from 1939-1975.
0 @N6000000002176686907@ NOTE After being under regency of his mother from 1886-1902, his reign was marked
